From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:58:19 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] iommu/apple-dart: Map retained DARTs non-posted like every
 other DART

apple_dart_retained_ioremap() maps the J713 radio and display DARTs with
plain ioremap(). Those DARTs sit under a bus with nonposted-mmio, so
their resources carry IORESOURCE_MEM_NONPOSTED, and the normal
devm_platform_get_and_ioremap_resource() path would have used
ioremap_np(). Posted writes to Apple SoC MMIO can complete late and
surface as asynchronous SErrors.

Use ioremap_np() when the resource asks for it, as
__devm_ioremap_resource() does.

Fixes: 0877cd766126 ("arm64: apple: enable J713 Bluetooth with scoped radio DMA")
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Ryan Murray <ryan@aurorasilicon.org>
(cherry picked from commit 76c60f1468853b4d28e3fed6e9c207c8a2f28410)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c b/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
index b643e411a2..a4edadf777 100644
--- a/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
+++ b/drivers/iommu/apple-dart.c
@@ -495,7 +495,11 @@ static void __iomem *apple_dart_retained_ioremap(struct apple_dart *dart,
 						resource_size(res), dev_name(dart->dev));
 	if (ret)
 		return IOMEM_ERR_PTR(ret);
-	ptr = ioremap(res->start, resource_size(res));
+	/* Match devm_ioremap_resource(): Apple SoC MMIO is non-posted. */
+	if (res->flags & IORESOURCE_MEM_NONPOSTED)
+		ptr = ioremap_np(res->start, resource_size(res));
+	else
+		ptr = ioremap(res->start, resource_size(res));
 	if (!ptr || apple_dart_manage_retained_resource(dart, (__force void *)ptr,
 				resource_size(res), apple_dart_unmap_retained_mmio))
 		return IOMEM_ERR_PTR(-ENOMEM);
